==============
     k8s
==============

it's a continer mgmt tool developed by google
exyension of docker can manage containers it can handle scaling
or 
k8s is an open-source container mgmt tool which automates container deployment,container (de)scaling & container load balancing
 benefit: works brilliantly with all cloud vendors :public,hybrid & on-premises

containers are good
both linux & docker container isolates the app from the host
but not easily manageable

faster,reliable,effecient,light-weight,scalable 

problems with scaling up containers
1 containers could not communvicate with each other
2. cnt had to be deployed & managed carefully
3. Autoscaling was not possible
4.Distributing traffic was still challenging

in k8s we create a pod & inside the pod the container is present
pod is a wrapper around the container
we can have multiple container in pod but its preffered to have one container

 ------------------------k8s controller----------------------------------------

1 kubectl we need to create a pod with ubuntu
2.scheduler decide in which node the pod will be created
3.kubelet interact with API server
kubelet will take to docker and create pod with container 
4.kubelet sends the metadata of the pod & machine to API server
-CPU utilization -RAM -Pod -pod utilization
5.all the metadata of the cluster &pod is saved in etcd 

